      en: ["The Siguiri mine is majority-owned and operated by AngloGold Ashanti.", "Gold from this region historically fueled the wealth of the Mali Empire.", "The facility uses advanced Carbon-in-Pulp (CIP) technology for extraction.", "The mine consistently produces over 200,000 ounces of gold per year.", "The mining lease covers an extensive area of over 1,500 square kilometers.", "Siguiri serves as a major training ground for Guinean mining professionals."]
